issue_context.body:
[Query.iter](https://docs.rs/bevy/latest/bevy/ecs/system/struct.Query.html#method.iter) does not indicate that it iterates over entities uniquely. That is:

```rust
fn system(q: Query<Entity, Filters>) {
    let mut set = HashSet::new();
    q.iter().for_each(|entity| {
        if !set.insert(entity) {
            panic!();
        }
    });
}
```

Will never panic.
